OL,3,AUS Army says controlled blast of       
OL,4,Aexplosives in Iowa was 'huge success'  
OL,6,FThe US military has hailed as a "huge  
OL,7,Fsuccess" the detonation of nearly five 
OL,8,Ftonnes of toxic explosives in Iowa, an 
OL,9,Foperation that sparked fears of health 
OL,10,Fand environmental problems across the  
OL,11,Fregion.                                
OL,13,FSmoke was seen rising into the sky     
OL,14,Fshortly after 09:00 local time (14:00  
OL,15,FGMT) following the explosion, as the   
OL,16,FArmy declared the risk "as close to    
OL,17,Fzero as is absolutely humanly          
OL,18,Fpossible".                             
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
