OL,3,AUS Army says controlled blast of       
OL,4,Aexplosives in Iowa was 'huge success'  
OL,6,FPlans to detonate the lead azide, a    
OL,7,Fvolatile compound reportedly at risk of
OL,8,Fexploding on its own, were paused      
OL,9,Fseveral times before the blast         
OL,10,Ffollowing public outcry and legal      
OL,11,Fchallenges.                            
OL,13,FOn Wednesday evening, the Army said    
OL,14,Fthat an "all clear" has been issued    
OL,15,Faround the ammunition plant.           
